# Title: Unusual File Download from Direct IP Address
# ID: 025bd229-fd1f-4fdb-97ab-20006e1a5368
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-07
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004
# Description: Detects the download of suspicious file type from URLs with IP
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (regex Contents="(?i)http[s]?://[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}\\.[0-9]{1,3}" AND (file_name="*.ps1:Zone*" OR file_name="*.bat:Zone*" OR file_name="*.exe:Zone*" OR file_name="*.vbe:Zone*" OR file_name="*.vbs:Zone*" OR file_name="*.dll:Zone*" OR file_name="*.one:Zone*" OR file_name="*.cmd:Zone*" OR file_name="*.hta:Zone*" OR file_name="*.xll:Zone*" OR file_name="*.lnk:Zone*"))
